fizz score v1
# Ambient Bed: slow, wide and warm in F major (upgraded from the ambient-bed seed).
# Shows: chords held across bar lines, a filter lfo, a lead entering mid-section,
# a gain ramp on a reused section, a noise wash, and tone/mix intent instead of raw fx.
